# Chat evaluation harness. Deliberately unpublished: the golden questions encode
# the ways this chat can be made to misbehave (injection probes, extraction
# attempts, the claims it must refuse to invent), which is operational knowledge
# rather than something the site benefits from shipping. The durable copy lives
# in the private vault - see backend/README.md.
evals/

# Addresses submitted through the contact flow are emailed and not persisted,
# so nothing writes this file. The rule stays because a copy left by an earlier
# run holds third-party personal data and this repository is public.
collected_emails.json
